WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.175
Unit seventeen. Body Safety and Trusted Adults!

2
00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:09.007
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:09.057 --> 00:00:12.510
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.179
Today we learn about Body Safety and Trusted Adults. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.905 --> 00:00:21.338
Body. Say it with me. Body!

6
00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:28.434
Private. Say it with me. Private!

7
00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:35.365
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

8
00:00:38.856 --> 00:00:42.623
Unsafe. Say it with me. Unsafe!

9
00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:49.208
No. Say it with me. No!

10
00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:55.863
Tell. Say it with me. Tell!

11
00:00:59.343 --> 00:01:03.209
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

12
00:01:06.709 --> 00:01:10.059
Secret. Say it with me. Secret!

13
00:01:13.579 --> 00:01:23.130
My body is mine, and some parts are private. If someone makes me feel unsafe, I say no, get away, and tell a trusted adult. I never keep a secret that makes me feel scared.

14
00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.331
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:30.881
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.931 --> 00:01:32.033
Safe!

17
00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:38.090
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.462
Trusted adult!

19
00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:48.232
Did you know? A good secret is a nice surprise like a present — a bad secret makes you feel worried, so you should tell!

20
00:01:48.282 --> 00:01:50.289
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.018 --> 00:01:58.747
Think and answer. Name three trusted adults you could talk to.

22
00:01:58.797 --> 00:01:59.947
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.183 --> 00:02:06.052
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.102 --> 00:02:08.781
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

